SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Page updated: Maine Judicial Branch Jury Stat
 us Notices
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nRemoved
 :\n  - Piscataquis Judicial Center - Dover-Foxcroft\, Maine\n  - All juror
 s on Dupuis vs Robinson Hardware need to appear on Thursday morning at 8:3
 0 am. If you have any questions please call 564-2240.\n  - If there is inc
 lement weather\, please go to www.courts.maine.gov for updates.\n  - PROHI
 BITION OF ELECTRONIC DEVICES: Please be advised that pursuant to Administr
 ative Order JB-20-01\, use of electronic devices during trial or while in 
 deliberations are prohibited and all devices will need to be temporarily s
 urrendered. During jury selection\, all devices must be turned off.\n  - S
 eptember 23\, 0000\n  - Sagadahoc County Superior Court\n  - If you were s
 elected for\n  - Panel One\n  - \,\n  - State of Maine v. Nicholas Kierman
 \n  - \, please report to the\n  - Sagadahoc County Superior Court\n  - lo
 cated at\n  - 752 High Street\n  - in\n  - Bath\n  - on\n  - Tuesday\, Sep
 tember 22nd\, 2026\, at 9:00 a.m.\n  - That is jurors 3\, 4\, 25\, 42\, 89
 \, 123\, 161\, 190\, 192\, 203\, 206\, 209\, 215\, 231\, & 281\n  - Please
  be advised that parking at the courthouse is limited. There is parking av
 ailable on the street. If you receive a ticket for extended parking please
  bring it to the clerk's office and it will be waived\, however tickets fo
 r illegal parking will not be.\n  - September 21\, 2026\nhttps://www.court
 s.maine.gov/juror/notice.shtml
URL:https://www.courts.maine.gov/juror/notice.shtml
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
